<html lang="ar" dir="rtl"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>الدفع بالحوالة المصرفية | صندوق الزكاة سرت</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;background:#eef3f7;color:#18394c}a{color:#12658a;text-decoration:none}.page{min-height:100vh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(370px,510px);direction:ltr}.backdrop{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b3847dd,#0e607aaa),linear-gradient(45deg,#dcece9,#e8f3fa);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:36px;direction:rtl}.hero{max-width:560px;color:#fff;text-align:center}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(27px,3vw,44px);line-height:1.45}.hero p{font-size:17px;line-height:2}.hero a{display:inline-block;color:#fff;border:1px solid #ffffffa8;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 25px;margin-top:12px}.panel{direction:rtl;background:#fff;min-height:100vh;box-shadow:-10px 0 35px #0b273328;position:relative}.panel-head{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e4edf1;padding:24px 26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.panel-head h2{margin:0;font-size:23px}.close{border:1px solid #d6e1e7;background:#f6f9fa;color:#153e4e;border-radius:9px;font-size:24px;width:39px;height:39px;text-align:center;line-height:36px}.content{padding:23px 28px 40px;max-width:600px;margin:auto}.eyebrow{color:#14708b;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold}.target{font-size:20px;margin:7px 0 16px;line-height:1.6}.info{background:#e9f7f0;border:1px solid #ccead9;border-radius:12px;color:#176144;padding:13px 16px;line-height:1.9;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:18px}.error{background:#fff1f1;border:1px solid #f5c7c7;color:#9d2525;border-radius:9px;padding:12px;margin:12px 0}.section-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;margin:22px 0 10px}.amount-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}.amount-btn{background:#f7fafc;color:#163e51;border:1px solid #ccdce4;border-radius:9px;padding:12px 5px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}.amount-btn.selected,.amount-btn:hover{background:#11546a;color:#fff;border-color:#11546a}label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;margin:17px 0 7px}input,select{width:100%;padding:12px 13px;border:1px solid #c7d6dd;border-radius:10px;font:inherit;background:#fff;color:#16394b}input:focus,select:focus{outline:2px solid #5bacc6;outline-offset:1px}.bank-card{border:1px solid #d7e5e8;border-radius:14px;background:#f6faf9;padding:16px;margin-top:15px}.bank-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e3eeee;font-size:13px}.bank-line:last-child{border:0}.bank-line strong{overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:left;direction:ltr}.copy{background:#e3f1f1;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 9px;color:#125368;cursor:pointer}.upload{display:block;border:2px dashed #b4cbd4;border-radius:13px;text-align:center;padding:22px 12px;background:#fafdfd;cursor:pointer}.upload input{margin-top:10px;font-size:12px}.submit{background:#11566a!important;color:#fff!important;border:0;border-radius:11px;padding:16px;width:100%;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:24px;cursor:pointer}.submit:hover{background:#0a394c!important}.muted{color:#617989;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}.status{background:#eaf7ed;color:#17633c;border-radius:9px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:12px}@media(max-width:820px){.page{display:block}.backdrop{display:none}.panel{min-height:100vh}.content{padding:18px}.panel-head{padding:16px 18px}}

/* Phase 22 — institutional design */
:root{--navy:#0c2f55;--blue:#10518f;--ink:#16324d;--gold:#b99151;--line:#dce6f0;--soft:#f4f8fc}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{font-family:'Cairo',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif!important;background:#edf3fa;color:var(--ink)}
.page{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(430px,550px)}
.backdrop{background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%,#23689c99,transparent 38%),linear-gradient(140deg,#092845,#164b78 65%,#0c3559);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.backdrop:before{content:'✦';position:absolute;font-size:260px;color:#ffffff0a;top:-110px;left:-20px}
.hero{text-align:right;max-width:530px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(29px,3vw,44px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1px}.hero p{font-size:16px;opacity:.88}.hero a{border-color:#e3c28c;color:#fff}.hero a:hover{background:#ffffff17}
.panel{box-shadow:-18px 0 55px #09284524}.panel-head{padding:23px 32px;border-color:var(--line)}.panel-head h2{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy)}.close{font-family:Arial;font-weight:400;display:grid;place-items:center;line-height:1;transition:.2s}.close:hover{background:#e9f1fa}
.content{padding:25px 34px 55px}.eyebrow{color:var(--blue);font-weight:800}.target{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy)}
.info{background:#edf5ff;border-color:#c9def4;color:#234d76;padding:15px 18px;border-right:4px solid var(--blue)}
.section-title{color:var(--navy);font-size:16px;font-weight:800;margin:30px 0 13px;padding-bottom:9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.amount-grid{gap:10px}.amount-btn{border-radius:12px;padding:13px 5px;font:700 14px 'Cairo',sans-serif;background:#f6f9fd;border-color:#d5e1ed;transition:.18s}.amount-btn.selected,.amount-btn:hover{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 5px 15px #10518f30}
label{font-weight:700;color:#24415c;margin-top:16px}input,select{font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;border-radius:11px;border-color:#cfddea;background:#fcfdff;min-height:49px}input:focus,select:focus{outline:0;border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #10518f1c}
.bank-card{background:#f3f8fd;border-color:#d5e3f0;padding:17px 20px}.bank-line{border-color:#dce8f3;padding:12px 0}.bank-line strong{font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:13px}.copy{font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;background:#e2effa;color:#0b4c82;padding:6px 12px;font-weight:700}.copy:hover{background:#cbdff3}
.upload{background:#f7fbff;border-color:#a8c4e0;padding:24px 16px;transition:.2s}.upload:hover{border-color:var(--blue);background:#eef6ff}.upload input{min-height:auto;background:transparent;border:0;padding:8px 0}
.submit{background:var(--blue)!important;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;border-radius:12px;padding:15px;box-shadow:0 9px 23px #10518f2a;transition:.2s}.submit:hover{background:#083c6b!important;transform:translateY(-1px)}.muted{font-size:12px;color:#63788e}
.sz-steps{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-content:space-between;margin:5px 0 25px}.sz-step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#5e7892;white-space:nowrap}.sz-step span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:27px;height:27px;border-radius:50%;background:#e7f0f9;color:var(--blue);font:700 12px Arial}.sz-step:first-child span{background:var(--blue);color:white}.sz-sep{height:1px;background:#d5e1ed;flex:1}.sz-trust{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 15px;background:#f4f8fc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;font-size:12px;color:#506d88;margin:20px 0}
body.sz-embedded{background:transparent}.sz-embedded .page{display:block;min-height:100vh}.sz-embedded .backdrop{display:none}.sz-embedded .panel{min-height:100vh;box-shadow:none}.sz-embedded .panel-head{position:sticky}
@media(max-width:820px){.page{display:block}.backdrop{display:none}.content{padding:19px}.panel-head{padding:18px}.sz-steps{gap:4px}.sz-step{font-size:10px}.sz-step span{width:24px;height:24px}}
@media(max-width:420px){.amount-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.bank-line{flex-wrap:wrap}.content{padding:16px}}

/* Keep the donation amount in Western numerals (0-9). */
#amount.sz-western-digits{direction:ltr!important;text-align:left!important;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif!important;font-variant-numeric:lining-nums tabular-nums;unicode-bidi:isolate}

/* Force Latin digit glyphs for amounts without changing the Arabic interface font. */
#amount, .amount-btn {font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif!important;font-variant-numeric:lining-nums tabular-nums;unicode-bidi:isolate;}
#amount {direction:ltr!important;text-align:left!important;}
.amount-btn {direction:ltr!important;}
</style></head><body><div class="page"><div class="backdrop"><div class="hero"><h1>تبرعك يصنع فرقًا في حياة الآخرين</h1><p>ساهم في دعم المشاريع الخيرية وطلبات الإعانة المعتمدة في مدينة سرت. اختر المبلغ وحوّله للحساب الرسمي، ثم أرفق الإيصال للمراجعة.</p><a href="{{ url('/') }}">العودة إلى الصفحة الرئيسية</a></div></div><aside class="panel"><header class="panel-head"><h2>الدفع بالحوالة المصرفية</h2><a class="close" href="{{ url('/') }}" aria-label="إغلاق">×</a></header><main class="content"><div class="sz-steps"><div class="sz-step"><span>1</span>تحديد المبلغ</div><div class="sz-sep"></div><div class="sz-step"><span>2</span>إجراء التحويل</div><div class="sz-sep"></div><div class="sz-step"><span>3</span>رفع الإيصال</div></div><span class="eyebrow">الجهة المستفيدة من التبرع</span><h1 class="target">{{ $type === 'project' ? $target->title : 'دعم طلب إعانة معتمد' }}</h1><div class="info">حوّل المبلغ إلى الحساب الرسمي، ثم ارفع الإيصال. لن يُحتسب التبرع إلا بعد تحقق الإدارة من وصول الحوالة.</div>
